---
import MainLayout from "../../layouts/MainLayout.astro";
---

<MainLayout title="Services | Otterock - Digital Engineering with Purpose">
  <section class="max-w-6xl mx-auto py-20 px-6">
    <div class="text-center mb-20">
      <span
        class="text-amber-800 font-bold tracking-widest uppercase text-xs mb-4 block font-body"
        >What we do for you</span
      >
      <h1
        class="text-5xl md:text-7xl font-black text-otter-deep mb-6 font-display leading-tight"
      >
        Solutions that <span class="text-amber-800">leave a mark.</span>
      </h1>
      <p
        class="text-xl text-slate-700 max-w-3xl mx-auto font-body leading-relaxed"
      >
        We fuse cutting-edge engineering with a social purpose. We build digital
        tools that don't just grow, but transform realities.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
      <div
        class="bg-white p-8 rounded-[2.5rem] border border-otter-deep/5 shadow-sm hover:shadow-2xl transition-all group hover:-translate-y-2 duration-500"
      >
        <div
          class="w-16 h-16 bg-otter-sand rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center text-3xl mb-6 group-hover:bg-otter-deep group-hover:text-otter-sand transition-all duration-500 shadow-inner"
        >
          🚀
        </div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 font-display text-otter-deep">
          Elite Frontend
        </h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600 mb-6 text-sm font-body leading-relaxed">
          Ultra-fast websites with <strong>Astro</strong>. We optimize every
          millisecond so Google loves you and your customers don't wait.
        </p>
        <ul
          class="text-[11px] space-y-2 text-otter-deep/70 font-bold uppercase tracking-wider font-body"
        >
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="text-amber-800">✔</span> Core Web Vitals 100/100
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="text-amber-800">✔</span> Instant Loading
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="text-amber-800">✔</span> Native Technical SEO
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div
        class="bg-white p-8 rounded-[2.5rem] border-2 border-otter-accent/20 shadow-md hover:shadow-2xl transition-all group hover:-translate-y-2 duration-500 relative overflow-hidden"
      >
        <div
          class="absolute top-0 right-0 p-4 opacity-10 group-hover:opacity-20 transition-opacity"
        >
          <span class="text-4xl">⚡</span>
        </div>
        <div
          class="w-16 h-16 bg-otter-accent/10 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center text-3xl mb-6 text-amber-800 group-hover:bg-otter-accent group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-500"
        >
          🔋
        </div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 font-display text-otter-deep">
          Dynamic Backend
        </h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600 mb-6 text-sm font-body leading-relaxed">
          We power your website with <strong>Supabase</strong>. Real-time data,
          user, and content management with bank-grade security.
        </p>
        <ul
          class="text-[11px] space-y-2 text-otter-deep/70 font-bold uppercase tracking-wider font-body"
        >
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="text-amber-800">✔</span> Real-time Databases
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="text-amber-800">✔</span> Secure Authentication
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="text-amber-800">✔</span> Total Scalability
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div
        class="bg-white p-8 rounded-[2.5rem] border border-otter-deep/5 shadow-sm hover:shadow-2xl transition-all group hover:-translate-y-2 duration-500"
      >
        <div
          class="w-16 h-16 bg-otter-sand rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center text-3xl mb-6 group-hover:bg-otter-deep group-hover:text-otter-sand transition-all duration-500 shadow-inner"
        >
          🔍
        </div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 font-display text-otter-deep">
          Authority SEO
        </h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600 mb-6 text-sm font-body leading-relaxed">
          You don't just exist, you stand out. Keyword strategies designed so
          the customer finds you first.
        </p>
        <ul
          class="text-[11px] space-y-2 text-otter-deep/70 font-bold uppercase tracking-wider font-body"
        >
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="text-amber-800">✔</span> Semantic Audit
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="text-amber-800">✔</span> Keyword Strategy
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="text-amber-800">✔</span> Guaranteed Indexing
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div
        class="bg-white p-8 rounded-[2.5rem] border border-otter-deep/5 shadow-sm hover:shadow-2xl transition-all group hover:-translate-y-2 duration-500"
      >
        <div
          class="w-16 h-16 bg-otter-sand rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center text-3xl mb-6 group-hover:bg-otter-deep group-hover:text-otter-sand transition-all duration-500 shadow-inner"
        >
          🎨
        </div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 font-display text-otter-deep">
          Organic Design
        </h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600 mb-6 text-sm font-body leading-relaxed">
          Human interfaces that breathe. We design experiences that naturally
          guide the user towards making a purchase.
        </p>
        <ul
          class="text-[11px] space-y-2 text-otter-deep/70 font-bold uppercase tracking-wider font-body"
        >
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="text-amber-800">✔</span> Minimalist & Modern UI
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="text-amber-800">✔</span> Conversion-focused UX
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="text-amber-800">✔</span> Mobile First Design
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div
      class="mt-20 p-10 bg-otter-deep rounded-[3rem] text-otter-sand flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center gap-12 shadow-2xl"
    >
      <div class="md:w-1/2">
        <span
          class="text-otter-accent font-black uppercase text-xs tracking-[0.2em] mb-4 block"
          >Dynamic Ecosystems</span
        >
        <h3 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-6 font-display">
          Your data under your control, powered by us.
        </h3>
        <p class="opacity-80 leading-relaxed font-body text-lg">
          With the power of <strong>Supabase</strong>, we create custom
          dashboards where you can see the impact of your business in real time.
          From managing your customers to tracking the number of dog food bags
          donated, everything flows under a secure and transparent
          infrastructure.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="md:w-1/2 grid grid-cols-1 gap-4">
        <div
          class="p-8 bg-white/5 border border-white/10 rounded-3xl backdrop-blur-sm"
        >
          <p class="text-otter-accent font-bold mb-2">
            ● Transparent Management
          </p>
          <p class="text-sm opacity-70">
            We use GitHub and Vercel so you can see every change in real time.
            No black boxes.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div
          class="p-8 bg-white/5 border border-white/10 rounded-3xl backdrop-blur-sm"
        >
          <p class="text-otter-accent font-bold mb-2">● Total Ownership</p>
          <p class="text-sm opacity-70">
            The Supabase and Google accounts are yours. We are your technical
            guardians.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-24 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-otter-deep mb-8 font-display italic">
        Shall we build something worthwhile?
      </h2>
      <a
        href="/en/contacto"
        class="inline-block bg-otter-accent text-otter-deep px-12 py-5 rounded-full font-black uppercase tracking-widest hover:bg-otter-deep hover:text-white transition-all hover:scale-105 shadow-xl shadow-otter-accent/20"
      >
        Start my digital transformation
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</MainLayout>
